                                "example_id": "5fe927e9-2949-4b7b-a34f-e5d7e5a32cd4",
                                "sense_id": "88bdd020-207d-37a0-b1ce-d4b3c5b8812c",
                                "text": "Thus, there is a third kind of judgment, which we shall call characterization. The wa-phrase and ga-phrase serve syntactically to distinguish predicational judgment not only from nonpredicational description but also from characterizational judgment."
